<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Board Invitation</title>
    <style>
        body { 
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; 
            background-color: #f7f9fc; 
            margin: 0; 
            padding: 0; 
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
        }
        .wrapper {
            width: 100%;
            table-layout: fixed;
            background-color: #f7f9fc;
            padding-top: 40px;
            padding-bottom: 40px;
        }
        .container { 
            max-width: 600px; 
            margin: 0 auto; 
            background: #ffffff; 
            border-radius: 12px; 
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(149, 157, 165, 0.1); 
        }
        .header {
            background-color: #0052cc;
            padding: 30px 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .header h1 {
            color: #ffffff;
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 600;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }
        .content {
            padding: 40px 30px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        h2 { 
            color: #172b4d; 
            font-size: 20px;
            margin-top: 0;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }
        p { 
            color: #5e6c84; 
            line-height: 1.6; 
            font-size: 15px;
            margin: 0 0 24px 0;
        }
        .btn-container {
            margin: 32px 0;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #0052cc;
            color: #ffffff !important;
            padding: 14px 28px;
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(0, 82, 204, 0.25);
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }
        .footer { 
            background-color: #fafbfc;
            padding: 24px 30px;
            text-align: center; 
            border-top: 1px solid #dfe1e6; 
        }
        .footer p {
            font-size: 13px; 
            color: #97a0af; 
            margin: 0 0 8px 0;
        }
        .footer p:last-child {
            margin-bottom: 0;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="wrapper">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="header">
                <h1>Mini Trello</h1>
            </div>
            <div class="content">
                <h2>You've been invited!</h2>
                <p>Hello,</p>
                <p><strong>{{inviterName}}</strong> has invited you to collaborate on the board <strong>"{{boardName}}"</strong> on Mini Trello.</p>
                
                <div class="btn-container">
                    <a href="{{link}}" class="btn">Accept Invitation</a>
                </div>
                
                <p>Click the button above to view and accept your board invitation.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="footer">
                <p><strong>Mini Trello Team</strong></p>
                <p>If you don't want to join this board, you can safely ignore this email.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>